{"book":"joshua","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-30T00:08:14.020478213Z","verse":4,"ref":"joshua 3:4","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":3,"translation":"Only, a distance shall there be between you and between it — about two thousand cubits by measure. Do not come near to it, so that you may know ⟨את⟩ the way by which you walk, for you have not passed ⟨on⟩ this way yesterday or the day before.”","tokens":[{"surface":"אך","gloss":"only"},{"surface":"רחוק","gloss":"a distance"},{"surface":"יהיה","gloss":"shall there be"},{"surface":"ביניכם","gloss":"between you"},{"surface":"ובינו","gloss":"and between it"},{"surface":"כאלפים","gloss":"about two thousand"},{"surface":"אמה","gloss":"cubits"},{"surface":"במדה","gloss":"by measure"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"תקרבו","gloss":"come near"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"to it"},{"surface":"למען","gloss":"so that"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"תדעו","gloss":"you may know"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the way"},{"surface":"הדרך","gloss":"the way"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"תלכו","gloss":"you will walk"},{"surface":"בה","gloss":"on it"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"עברתם","gloss":"you have passed"},{"surface":"בדרך","gloss":"⟨on⟩ this way"},{"surface":"מתמול","gloss":"yesterday"},{"surface":"שלשום","gloss":"the day before"}]}